cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DocuScope Corpus Analysis & Concordancer in your research, please cite
  this software. After the JOSS article is accepted, update the doi field below
  with the JOSS DOI (and optionally add the Zenodo archive DOI under identifiers).
title: "DocuScope Corpus Analysis & Concordancer"
abstract: >-
  DocuScope CA is an open-source Streamlit application integrating DocuScope rhetorical
  tagging with part-of-speech and statistical corpus analysis for research and teaching.
